1.  "Default" widget MUST always be present

2. Widget passed variables:
- data{
	value    float  // curr sensor value
	diff     float  // diff between prev and curr value
	percents int    // calculated percents of min-max and value
	online   bool   // sensor operative?
	hint     string // sensor diag/other string
  }
- options{
	min       float  // min value
	max       float  // max value
	precision int    // display precision (like 1, 1.23, etc)
	suffix    string // sensor value legend (MBytes, GHz, %, etc)
  }
- aux{
	id       string     // sensor uniq id
	history  [100]float // last 100 stored 'percent' values
	historyR [100]float // last 100 stored '(100 - percent)' values
  }
